  "all_ingredients_flat": "1 cup ground chana dal (besan), 1 cup water, 1 tsp ginger, lemon juice (2 lemons), 1-4 green chilies (to taste), salt (to taste), ENO (1 tbsp), 10 curry leaves, 1 tsp mustard seeds, 4-5 green chillies, fresh cilantro, water, fresh coconut, fresh coriander",
  "instructions": "BATTER: Mix all dhokla ingredients. Whisk well. Add ENO. Mixture will start rising. Whisk again. Transfer mixture to a deep dish.\nDHOKLA: Pre-heat Instant Pot (IP) with 2 cups of water. Place ring, trivet & deep dish in IP. Pressure cook for 15 mins. Release steam & pull dish out immediately. Let cool.\nTARKA (Dressing): Heat tarka ingredients in a pan for a few mins.",
